estion-1761299981387\",\"position\":6,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761299981387\",\"name\":\"What are keywords in SEO?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Keywords are the words or phrases people type into search engines. SEO uses them to connect your content with what users are searching for.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761299988191\",\"position\":7,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761299988191\",\"name\":\"What are backlinks?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Backlinks are links from other websites to yours. They act like votes of trust that can improve your rankings if they come from reputable sources.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761299998601\",\"position\":8,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761299998601\",\"name\":\"Do I need coding skills for SEO?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Basic HTML knowledge helps, but it\u2019s not mandatory. Most SEO tasks can be done using tools or CMS platforms like WordPress.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761300020576\",\"position\":9,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761300020576\",\"name\":\"What is E-E-A-T in SEO?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"E-E-A-T stands for Experience, Expertise, Authoritativeness, and Trustworthiness \u2014 key factors Google uses to judge content quality.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Ques