n-1761299918706","name":"What is the full form of SEO?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"SEO stands for Search Engine Optimization.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761299924506","position":2,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761299924506","name":"What is On-Page SEO?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It refers to optimizing elements inside your website like titles, content, headings, and images so Google can understand your page better.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761299937315","position":3,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761299937315","name":"What is Off-Page SEO?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Off-Page SEO includes activities outside your website such as link building, guest posting, and social media engagement to build trust and authority.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761299957638","position":4,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761299957638","name":"What is Technical SEO?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Technical SEO ensures your site loads fast, is mobile-friendly, and can be easily crawled and indexed by search engines.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761299966494","position":5,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761299966494","name":"What is Local SEO?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Local SEO helps your business appear in searches made near your location, like \u201cbest salon near me\u201d or \u201cdoctor in Jaipur.\u201d","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761299981387","position":6,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761299981387","name":"What are keywords in SEO?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Keywords are the words or phrases people type into search engines. SEO uses them to connect your content with what users are searching for.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761299988191","position":7,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761299988191","name":"What are backlinks?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Backlinks are links from other websites to yours. They act like votes of trust that can improve your rankings if they come from reputable sources.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761299998601","position":8,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761299998601","name":"Do I need coding skills for SEO?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Basic HTML knowledge helps, but it\u2019s not mandatory. Most SEO tasks can be done using tools or CMS platforms like WordPress.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761300020576","position":9,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/#faq-question-1761300020576","name":"What is E-E-A-T in SEO?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"E-E-A-T stands for Experience, Expertise, Authoritativeness, and Trustworthiness \u2014 key factors Google uses to judge content quality.","inLanguage":"en-U